================================================================
Manual Conversion Approach
================================================================
Since DMS statement conversion consistently failed, all 7 statements were 
manually converted applying:
1. Lowercase schema object names (tables and columns) per DMS schema mappings
2. Schema prefix: productmanagement_dbo
3. SCOPE_IDENTITY() -> RETURNING clause with CTE
4. GETDATE() -> clock_timestamp() (matching DMS schema default values)
5. DECLARE/SET variables -> CTEs for capturing values
6. Transaction blocks -> Writable CTEs (PostgreSQL's data-modifying CTEs)
7. Integer division -> Cast to numeric for ROUND operations

All 7 statements:
